---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use · Ashiyana Real Estate"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the Ashiyana Real Estate website, including how to read the property and price information on it."
  h1="Terms of use"
  path="/terms"
  updated="21 October 2026"
>
  <p>By using {site.url.replace('https://', '')} you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>

  <h2>Information on this site</h2>
  <p>
    The information on this website is general guidance about our services and the areas we work in. Price bands,
    property types and distances are indicative, not offers or valuations. Prices, availability and terms change, so please
    confirm current details with us before making any decision.
  </p>
  <p>
    Featured properties, including the Sanaswadi industrial land, are subject to availability, final negotiation and your own
    due diligence. Nothing on this site is a commitment to sell at a stated price.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    We are property consultants, not lawyers, valuers registered with a bank, or financial advisers. Where a transaction needs a
    legal opinion or a formal valuation, we will recommend that you get one from a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Developer names and logos</h2>
  <p>
    Developer names and logos shown on this site belong to their owners. They show developers we have worked with; they are
    not an endorsement by those developers or an advertisement of any specific project.
  </p>

  <h2>Our fees</h2>
  <p>Any fee for our services is agreed with you in writing before we start work on your transaction.</p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    We take care to keep this website accurate, but we can't guarantee it is complete or error-free. To the extent the law
    allows, we are not liable for losses arising from reliance on information on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, and the courts in Pune have jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or
    {' '}<a href={`tel:${site.phone.e164}`}>{site.phone.display}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
